{
  "_comment": "M10 T0 frozen contract samples. Values mirror docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-30-rag-knowledge-m10-quality-workbench-design.md; tests recompute every formula example so a drifted constant fails loudly. Implementation tasks (T1+) must consume these exact values instead of re-deciding them inline.",
  "m9_acceptance": {
